This distribution is a path-filtered fork of the Zed monorepo, carrying the
gpui crates with their upstream history (see README.md and
scripts/upstream-paths.txt). Branch `main` is based on upstream commit
4b7369481dcf36f22ff8f813d411e1d296aebe57, whose tree over every file kept here
is identical to the originally pinned revision
c545fb67d0ce13e335bff76f7c08986000333f2c.

Modifications made by MGVS (Oleksandr Zhabotynskyi <alexlp@mgvs.org>):
  - Added a single-plane 32BGRA external-texture present path to the
    macOS/Metal backend, enabling zero-copy IOSurface/CVPixelBuffer
    presentation:
      crates/gpui_macos/src/metal_renderer.rs
      crates/gpui_macos/src/shaders.metal
  - Pruned the inherited workspace manifest to the crates carried here
    (Cargo.toml), and added fork documentation and upstream sync tooling
    (README.md, NOTICE, scripts/).

The original Apache-2.0 license and notices are retained in each crate's
LICENSE-APACHE file, as required by Apache License 2.0 Section 4.
